## Toolchain

```
rustup target add {{ t.rust_target }}
{% if t.cortex_m %}
cargo install probe-rs-tools --locked{{ " flip-link" if o.flip_link else "" }}
{% elif t.arch == "xtensa" %}
cargo install espup espflash
espup install && source ~/export-esp.sh
{% else %}
cargo install espflash
{% endif %}
{% if o.counters %}
cargo install cnt_cli   # provides `cnt`: {{ "cnt tui" if t.cortex_m else "cnt tui --chip " ~ t.probe_chip }} (TUI), cnt read, cnt reset
{% endif %}
```

## Run

```
cargo run            # dev profile
cargo run --release
```

